{
 "id": 1798059,
 "titulo": "9/12 Patch Details (Completed)",
 "fecha": 1694505764609,
 "modificada": 1758905455774,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1798059",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" data-error-type=\"RETRY\" id=\"1642728194502\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/4f8b670f4bb44859ac42285020b6dfde_1642728194502_d.jpg\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Through this patch, meet the noble rulers destined to protect their kingdom<br>\nand the rageful Mutant whose evil only grows further.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Black Panther </span>has become the true king of Wakanda<br>\nwith his new Uniform and Tier-4 Advancement.<br>\nAlso, a new Uniform for <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Black Panther (Shuri)</span>,&nbsp;<br>\nwho follows in the footsteps of her brother, has been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Meanwhile,<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"> Omega Red</span> will become an even greater threat to the X-Men&nbsp;<br>\nby upgrading his Carbonadium tentacles with Tier-3 Advancement.&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nAgents, check out the new skills and power of the updated heroes<br>\nby downloading the 9/12 Patch!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">■ 9/12 Patch Details</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Patch Schedule: 9/13 (Wed) 3:00&nbsp;(UTC+0), 9/12 (Tue) 20:00&nbsp;(PDT)&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[9/13 (Wed) 2:58&nbsp;(UTC+0), 9/12 (Tue) 19:58&nbsp;(PDT) added]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The patch has been completed as of 9/13 (Wed) 2:56&nbsp;(UTC+0), 9/12&nbsp;(Tue) 19:56&nbsp;(PDT).&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Please reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances&nbsp;<br>\nand </span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">the completion time will be announced once the patch has been finished</span><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">.<br>\n* The patch will be applied in waves, so the application time may vary by Agent.<br>\n* The game can still be accessed during the patch.<br>\nWhen the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ Two New Uniforms</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Two new Uniforms Black Panther &lt;King without a Crown&gt;&nbsp;<br>\nand Black Panther &lt;<em>Marvel Studios’ Black Panther: Wakanda Forever</em>&gt;&nbsp;<br>\nhave&nbsp;been added to the two Super Heroes who follow the noble spirit of Wakanda.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The two new Uniforms can be purchased after the 9/12 Patch data has been applied.<br>\n* The new Uniforms can be found and purchased in the Marvel Universe and the Uniform Room.<br>\n* New Uniform Skills are based on the following skill Level stats. (Tier-4 heroes: Lv. 10, Others: Lv. 6) &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1643\" id=\"1694495764239\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/0dbd9c2bbccf46b78a61bc19f52d1d46_1694495764239_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1404\" id=\"1694495764251\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/093c6c7be50048b59e69e416d2c8b5c9_1694495764251_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\">▣ Black Panther Tier-4 Advancement</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Black Panther is now available for Tier-4 Advancement.<br>\nAll Wakandans who have heard his call will follow their king.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"342\" id=\"1694495794268\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/b5e6133083c148649bc1752e482be8ae_1694495794268_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Omega Red Tier-3 Advancement</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Omega Red is now available for Tier-3 Advancement.<br>\nHe will whip his tentacles ruthlessly towards anyone who stops him.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"378\" id=\"1694495815058\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/cc434d30800647dcba6036fb5287c2a7_1694495815058_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1694495857104\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/7eb7c9927bcc4bea86a11144f6ad2f86_1694495857104.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ New Artifact</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">A new Artifact has been added for Black Panther.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The effects are based on the 6★ Artifact passive skill Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"296\" id=\"1694495873983\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/054a66fe7f5e4556a35b4a4eeaee6bec_1694495873983_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Game Error Fixes</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. Some texts for the effects of the C.T.P. of Conquest have been changed.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Only the text has been changed and the effects are the same as before.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We look forward to your active participation in the events&nbsp;<br>\nthat will be held to support the growth of the updated heroes.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1694495400184\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/05669c0a152747d38656ded45b8dc2e6_1694495400184_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n"
}